	(text "Scenario: battery-only → forced awake → USB hot-plug while BOOST_CMD remains asserted → autonomous charging → USB removal. Battery model includes 120 mΩ ESR. Battery model includes 120 mΩ ESR. I2 is the 3V3-converter input-power proxy. TPS613222A input power/discharge is modeled internally; legacy I3 is excluded from simulation."
